            {
                "entry_id": "101d7c31-eef5-34e9-b808-a9328edc53ad",
                "word": "vastigheid",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "93ec4c38-a472-4c83-b7b2-f6f0fb31a211",
                        "entry_id": "101d7c31-eef5-34e9-b808-a9328edc53ad",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "vastigheden"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a8d0c9cf-512e-3916-916f-7964ded0a63a",
                        "entry_id": "101d7c31-eef5-34e9-b808-a9328edc53ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "zekerheid dat zaken niet op een onvoorspelbare manier zullen veranderen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e16b35ed-0245-43f3-9639-478509fc156d",
                                "sense_id": "a8d0c9cf-512e-3916-916f-7964ded0a63a",
                                "text": "In de exacte wetenschappen valt de appel telkens even snel, en te allen tijde omlaag. Wij zijn weleens jaloers op zoveel vastigheid. Geen enkele politicoloog slaagde er ooit in om een verkiezingsuitslag perfect te voorspellen, of het was per ongeluk. Zoals Paul de Octopus, die voetbalresultaten kon orakelen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e22543e5-43e3-42c8-b6c8-35dcccf8c845",
                                "sense_id": "a8d0c9cf-512e-3916-916f-7964ded0a63a",
                                "text": "BMK en BOINK hopen dat het nieuwe kabinet voor meer vastigheid zorgt. Wittebol: ,,Ouders willen, nu het beter gaat met de economie, graag weer gebruik van de kinderopvang maken maar blijven huiverig over de rijksbijdrage. Ze vragen zich af of de kosten volgend jaar wel hetzelfde zullen zijn.’’"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9d3c4e2e-e5ea-4386-89f6-382d4aaa68ef",
                        "source_entry_id": "101d7c31-eef5-34e9-b808-a9328edc53ad",
                        "source_sense_id": "a8d0c9cf-512e-3916-916f-7964ded0a63a",
                        "target_lang_word": "certainty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "certainty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82323740-b9f5-37ee-a5fd-e406cacb1fa2",
                                        "entry_id": "288c45bf-0bcf-3eb0-9f43-79ec62fbbb6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being certain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6012bc03-bd3e-4c35-8552-2d71692055cf",
                                                "sense_id": "82323740-b9f5-37ee-a5fd-e406cacb1fa2",
                                                "text": "The certainty of punishment is the truest security against crimes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc45e397-2978-4ff2-9439-29d2bee2a66c",
                                                "sense_id": "82323740-b9f5-37ee-a5fd-e406cacb1fa2",
                                                "text": "That there may be Certainty upon an infallible Evidence in Matters of Science, I readily grant you. But since there once were Scepticks in Philosophy as well as Religion, such as doubted of every thing, I very much question, whether the whole World be agreed in this Point; unless you could assure me, that Race of Seekers is now extinct."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c297576-4969-3cf8-a148-cd5bd71c6fc5",
                                        "entry_id": "288c45bf-0bcf-3eb0-9f43-79ec62fbbb6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of being certain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d4f14c3-62ec-3fb7-934a-bad0b9e3b61f",
                                        "entry_id": "288c45bf-0bcf-3eb0-9f43-79ec62fbbb6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fact or truth unquestionably established."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "326d0653-157f-4427-94cb-d4a05f99916d",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4f14c3-62ec-3fb7-934a-bad0b9e3b61f",
                                                "text": "Certainties are uninteresting and sating."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "676718c9-6f13-46f3-8f1c-7404ca99e1cc",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4f14c3-62ec-3fb7-934a-bad0b9e3b61f",
                                                "text": "There is a certainty attainable. A certainty of feeling will arise through the very contemplation of Jesus. But there is also attainable a certainty of Reason."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adb4a9e9-7480-4ab7-8d97-15bf81af13aa",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4f14c3-62ec-3fb7-934a-bad0b9e3b61f",
                                                "text": "Yet the truth is that City would probably have been coasting by that point if the referee, Michael Oliver, had not turned down three separate penalties, at least two of which could be accurately described as certainties."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "91dfe3ac-29a4-4842-a54d-581c74ee8bc4",
                        "source_entry_id": "101d7c31-eef5-34e9-b808-a9328edc53ad",
                        "source_sense_id": "a8d0c9cf-512e-3916-916f-7964ded0a63a",
